 "_doc": "South African National Parks (Kruger National Park, Skukuza branch) one-page TAX INVOICE: masthead with SANParks' own VAT number, Invoice No., Date, Branch, an order row (Order No., Debtor ID = account, customer VAT, terms), one item line 'ELEC-SK  1.00  Electricity - Skukuza-dd/mm to dd/mm' with Unit Price ex VAT, VAT and VAT-incl total, and a TOTAL row (VAT, incl). A lump-sum electricity recharge: no kWh, meter or readings are printed, so the ex-VAT amount is mapped to other_r and total_ex_vat_r; read_start/read_end are the dd/mm period as printed (no year); site = Branch. IDENTITY san_total_ex_check_r = printed TOTAL incl - TOTAL VAT: exact on 9/9 bills. Fingerprint: SANParks VAT number + 'Kruger Nat Park'/'Electricity - Skukuza' (the customer VAT in the order row is not used). 0 contradiction checks.",
